            "communityId": "wilmington-de",
            "title": "Rodney Square Farmers Market returns June 7 \u2014 SNAP/EBT accepted",
            "summary": "The Rodney Square Farmers Market opens its 2026 season on June 7. The market accepts SNAP and EBT benefits and features 20+ local vendors through October.",
            "body": "The Rodney Square Farmers Market returns for its 2026 season beginning Saturday, June 7. The market will run every Saturday from 9am to 1pm through October 31, 2026, in the heart of downtown Wilmington.\n\nThis season features more than 20 confirmed local vendors offering fresh produce, dairy, proteins, baked goods, and prepared foods. The market accepts SNAP/EBT benefits, and several vendors participate in the Double Up Food Bucks program, which matches SNAP spending dollar-for-dollar on fresh fruits and vegetables up to $20 per visit.\n\nRodney Square is located at 1000 N. King Street, Wilmington, DE 19801. Parking is available in nearby garages. The market is accessible via DART bus routes 2, 6, and 11.",
            "contentSource": {
              "id": "wilmington-farmers-market",
              "name": "Wilmington Farmers Market",
